शरीरस्थोऽपि कौन्तेय न करोति न लिप्यते ॥ ३२ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":3798,\"bb\":3344,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/13/32/b3344/\",\"body_value\":\"anāditvān nirguṇatvāt
